      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Mose aduga ku musozi Nebo avuye mu kiyaya c’i Mowabu, aja kw’isonga rya Pisiga, aharabana na Yeriko. Ahagaze aho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " amwereka ca gihugu cose, kuva i Gileyadi gushika i Dani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "intara yose ya Nafutali, iya Efurayimu n’iya Manase, intara yose ya Yuda ishika ku Kiyaga Mediterane, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abona Negebu n’intara yose iva mu kiyaya ca Yeriko igaca mu gisagara c’ibigazi igashika i Zowari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abarira Mose ati: “Ico ni co gihugu nasezeranishije indahiro Aburahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, igihe navuga nti: ‘Nzogiha uruvyaro rwanyu.’ Nakuretse ngo ukiboneshe amaso yawe, ariko ntuzojabuka ngo ucinjiremwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Mose umusavyi w’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " aca apfira aho i Mowabu, nk’uko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarabivuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuhamba i Mowabu, mu kiyaya kirabana n’i Beti-Peyori, ariko gushika n’ubu nta wuzi aho imva yiwe iherereye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose yapfuye amaze imyaka ijana na mirongo ibiri, ariko amaso yiwe yari akibona neza, kandi yari agifise inkomezi yamanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Abisirayeli bagandarira Mose imisi mirongo itatu mu kiyaya ca Mowabu, gushika ikiringo co kugandara giheze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe Yosuwa mwene Nuni yari yuzuye impwemu y’ubwenge, kuko Mose yari yamurambitseko ibiganza. Maze Abisirayeli baramwumvira, bagakora ivyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarategetse Mose vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuva ico gihe, nta muvugishwa yasubiriye kubaho muri Isirayeli yangana na Mose, uwibonanira n’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " amaso mu yandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uwakoze ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza nk’ivyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yatumye Mose gukora muri Egiputa, kuri Farawo no ku batware biwe, no ku gihugu cose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nta n’umwe yigeze akora ibikorwa bikomeye kandi biteye ubwoba nk’ivyo Mose yakoreye mu maso y’Abisirayeli bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
